      "id": "word-somos--identity",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "somos",
      "answerEn": "we are (an identity or defining description)",
      "noteEn": "Somos is the present form of ser used with nosotros or nosotras, “we.” Ser presents an identity, category, or defining description; estamos normally presents a state or location instead.",
      "example": {
        "es": "Somos vecinos.",
        "en": "We are neighbors."
